  "notes": "Programme list = the 58 bachelor programmes in HU's official English fee schedule 'The programs and the fees in JD _2027' (Finance unit page, unitid=42000000); English names come from it. The Arabic version of that PDF could not be fetched (URL too long for the tool), so Arabic names were taken from other official HU pages: parallel-programme announcements (newsid 37977, 37597), new-majors news (33663), the 2021-2024 strategic plan PDF, and the major column of an official HU admitted-students list. Arabic spellings are kept as HU writes them, including missing hamzas (e.g. 'ادارة اعمال', 'اللغة العربية وادابها'). PDF-extraction artefacts were fixed in 'التصوير الطبي والاشعاعي', 'التغذية السريرية والحميات' and 'هندسة البرمجيات', and a typo in 'ادراة الموارد التراثية والمتاحف' was corrected to 'ادارة'. NOT VERIFIED in Arabic on an official page: 'التكنولوجيا المالية' (Financial Technology), 'الموارد الطبيعية في الأراضي الجافة' (Dry Lands Natural Resources; a HU news item only calls it 'الموارد الطبيعية'), and the programme 'التربية البدنية وعلوم الرياضة' (copied from the faculty name). Nursing is offered as 'علم التمريض' with separate male and female sections. HU also lists Psychological Counseling under the Faculty of Educational Sciences. Left out: the Technical College (الكلية التقنية), because no bachelor or diploma programmes were found listed for it, and the Faculty of Graduate Studies. Email: the staff webmail link is Google Workspace for hu.edu.jo, and the site links students to Office 365 (mail.office365.com). No official page confirming the student address domain was found, so a student subdomain such as std.hu.edu.jo is unverified and not included. Center: no coordinates were found on the university site, Wikipedia or Wikidata, so center is null. It needs to be filled from OpenStreetMap (the campus is roughly 25 km northeast of Amman, near Zarqa). brand_color is null: Wikipedia lists the colours as orange and red, but no official hex value was found. The academic calendar link points to the page HU labels as the calendar. HU also has a calendar archive at hu.edu.jo/unitcenter/CalArchive.aspx?unitid=40000000."
